# payloads would make FI-9 commit real Sportmonks payloads by default -- into a
# public repo, before licensing question 3 ("does the license permit storing raw
# API data internally?") is answered on trial day 1. Frozen example reports live
# in packages/sportmonks-client/trial-reports/examples/ and ARE tracked.
packages/sportmonks-client/trial-output/

